diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 189669f..33c0658 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -222,6 +222,14 @@ Chat widget endpoint is configured with `REACT_APP_CHAT_LINK`.
 - Copy `.env.example` to `.env`
 - Set `REACT_APP_CHAT_LINK` to your chatbot websocket URL (for example, `wss://api.kumush.ai/api/v1/chat/<chatbot-id>/ws`)
 
+The personal path page (`/personal-path`) and its decisions and checkpoints on module pages need the
+[Personalized Roadmap API](https://github.com/mishalilia/personalized-roadmap):
+
+- Set `PERSONAL_PATH_API` to the API's address (for example, `https://api.path.example.com`). When it is empty,
+  the page says that personal paths are not set up, and module pages are unchanged.
+- Optionally set `PYODIDE_URL` to where coding problems load Python in the learner's browser. Empty uses the
+  jsDelivr CDN; to serve it from this site, copy Pyodide 0.26.4 into `static/pyodide/` and set `/pyodide/`.
+
 ### Troubleshooting
 
 - Verify dependencies: `npm install`
